BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 479 Td (   - Traced `app/jobs/isolate_job.rb` \(`IsolateJob < ApplicationJob`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 466 Td (   - The ActiveJob background worker executes `initialize_workdir`, which calculates ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 453 Td (  the box identifier as `@box_id = submission.id % 2147483647` and invokes `isolate #) Tj ET
