BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 427 Td (   - The Isolate box ID is **not** available prior to `initialize_workdir`. It become) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 414 Td (  s active and guaranteed allocated immediately upon completion of the `isolate --ini) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 401 Td (  t` command.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 388 Td (   - Cleanups occur inside `cleanup`, which invokes `isolate #{cgroups} -b #{box_id} ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 375 Td (  --cleanup`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 362 Td (2. **Safe Structured Correlation Design:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 349 Td (   - **Zero Raw Token Exposure:** Raw client submission tokens \(`submission.token`\) a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 336 Td (  re never written to logs. Logging raw bearer tokens creates credential leakage risk) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 323 Td (  s.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 310 Td (   - **Keyed HMAC Opaque Hash:** A 16-character keyed HMAC-SHA256 digest \(`token_hash) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 297 Td (  `\) is derived using a dedicated runner secret \(`CORRELATION_KEY`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 284 Td (   - **Per-Attempt Execution Identifier:** Each execution or retry generates an opaqu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 271 Td (  e `execution_id` \(`token_hash-timestamp-nonce`\) ensuring retried or concurrent runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 258 Td (   cannot be confused.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 245 Td (   - **Machine-Readable Telemetry:** Emits `[CORRELATION] token_hash=<hash> execution) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 232 Td (  _id=<id> box_id=<box_id> timestamp=<epoch>` only **after** the box directory has be) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 219 Td (  en verified created.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 206 Td (   - **Cleanup Telemetry:** Emits `[CORRELATION_CLEANUP] execution_id=<id> box_id=<bo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 193 Td (  x_id> timestamp=<epoch>`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 48 180 Td (3. **Reproducible Build Patch:**) Tj ET
